#MOBDATA
#31000
NAME  timekeeper old man midian~
SHORT Midian the aged Timekeeper is floating here.~
LONG  You almost cannot tell that this is Midian, his body is so aged and wrinkled.  He still wears his pristine chronomancers robes, though they seem to have been modified heavily with inlays of mysterisous silvery metal and strange symbols.~
DESCR
Time has not been kind to Midian.  His skin hangs in papery folds, mapped with
wrinkles so deep they seem carved rather than worn.  He drifts a hand's breadth
above the ground, weightless, as though the years have frayed away even his tie
to the earth.  The silvery inlays worked into his ancient robes pulse faintly in
time with nothing you can name, and his clouded eyes track something no one else
in the room can see.
~
