EXTRA  0 0
WEAR   0
LEVEL  0
WEIGHT 40
COST   0
COND   100
EDESC rock stone triangle triangular switch~
Set flush into the workshop wall is a stone shaped in too clean a triangle to be
natural -- each edge straight, each face flat.  Faint scratches around its rim
show where fingers have pressed it a thousand times.  It gives slightly when you
lean on it, as though it wants to sink into the wall.~
End

