EDESC apple ripe red~
The apple is flawless -- firm, unblemished, its skin a deep sunset red.  It looks
freshly fallen, though the tree above has borne nothing but rot for longer than
anyone can remember.  Held here in the cold air, it feels somehow out of place,
as though it belongs to a different season, or a different year entirely.~
End

