EDESC map parchment~
The map is scrawled in charcoal on a scrap of greasy parchment.  It sketches the
old road, the treeline, and the fresh scar of the landslide, with a crude X
inked over the mountains and, beside it, a single scratched word: "gold?"  Others
have come sniffing after the trap, then -- and got no further than this.~
End
