#31002
NAME   A narrow cave entrance~
DESCR
The walls press close here, slick with a thin film of moisture that catches what
little light reaches this deep.  Your breath fogs in front of you.  The floor is
loose scree, treacherous underfoot, and the passage bends sharply just ahead so
that you cannot see what lies beyond it.
~
