#31020
NAME   A small animal trail on the hillside~
DESCR
The hillside rolls gently away on every side, a sea of waving grass broken here
and there by grey knuckles of stone.  The trail dips through a shallow hollow
where the turf is greener and damper underfoot.  A hawk turns slow circles high
overhead, riding the warm air rising off the slope.
~
