#31022
NAME   A small animal trail on the hillside~
DESCR
The slope eases toward level ground here, and the trail begins to lose itself
among the thickening grass.  Clumps of gorse and bramble mark the way where the
animals have pushed through.  Ahead to the east the land opens flat and wide,
and you can just make out the edge of a broad grassy field.
~
