#31023
NAME   A small animal trail on the hillside~
DESCR
This is where the hillside finally surrenders to the flatland, the last gentle
roll of turf before the ground levels out entirely.  The animal trail fans out
and fades, its work done, scattering into a dozen faint tracks through the grass.
To the east the wildflower field begins, wide and bright under the open sky.
~
