EDESC stars reflection water sky~
When the sky is dark and the pond lies still, the whole field of stars comes
mirrored on the black water, so perfectly doubled that for a dizzy moment you
cannot tell which way is up.  It is easy to imagine a person sitting at this
pond's edge for hours, charting the heavens in the water at their feet.~
