#31028
NAME   A Small Dock At The Edge Of The Pond~
DESCR
Here on the east side of the pond there is a small wodden dock that still seems capable of supporting you.  There is an old swinging chair large enough for two that is half broken hear the grass at the beginning of the dock, but it seems to be old and unrepaired long enough that it has not been functional in quite some time.  Looking out over the pond you can see insects flitting about as the grass waves gently in the breeze.  The only ripples you see on the pond are from the waterbugs skimming the surface, and the occasionally stronger breeze gently pusing along.~
