#31035
NAME   Inside a Chronomancers House~
DESCR
The inside of the cottage is small but warm, and plainly loved.  A cook-fire
crackles low in a hearth of the same melted-looking stone as the walls outside,
and something savoury simmers in a pot hung above it.  Bundled herbs sway drying
from the rafters, a well-worn table stands beneath the window, and two mismatched
chairs are drawn up close together beside the fire.  Whoever lives here has built
a quiet, ordinary happiness within these walls -- though a curious draft, and a
faint metallic tang, drift in from the yard out back.~
