EDESC mud coins silt~
The mud of the shaft floor is studded with old coins, greened and blackened by
the years.  Most are copper and long past worthless, but here and there a worn
silver piece catches what little light falls from the world above.~
End

#31039
NAME   The Secret Workshop~
DESCR
This hidden chamber is a chronomancer's workshop, and a troubled one.  Strange
devices crowd every surface -- half-built armatures of brass and silver, glass
tubes clouded with old residue, and a great ring of graduated metal that turns
very slowly of its own accord and by all rights should not.  Loose notes drift
ankle-deep across the floor.  Every wall is bare, seamless stone, save one, where
a single triangular rock sits set a little too neatly among its rougher fellows.
This was where a desperate man did his last, worst work.~
