#31043
NAME   The Poorly Maintained Road~
DESCR
As you continue down this road the maintenance becomes poorer and poorer until
it's obvious that no one has come this way in years.  The cobblestone still is
visible here and there, but overall it almost looks like a dirt road at this
point.  You can see the road continues a bit further to the west of you, but
seems to end at the treeline a bit further.  To the north you can see the
towering heights of mountainst hat no one has survived passing over.  Their
snowy peaks loom in the distance, uncaring of the matters below.  The air is
crisp, almost stale, despite being so far from civilizationt hat there is no
evidence of people existing at all in any polace you look.
~
