#31045
NAME   The smooth wall of the cavern~
DESCR
The smooth, poured-looking stone dominates this stretch of the cavern entirely,
the rough natural rock reduced to a few stubborn patches.  Running your hand
along the wall you can feel the faintest seams, regular as brickwork, though no
mortar shows anywhere.  The passage bends here to follow the long curve of the
strange construction.
~
