NAME   The End of Time~
DESCR
Time seems to speed up as you move, accelerating until there is a blur of white
streaming past you faster than you can comprehend.  Suddenly everything stops,
and there is only black.  There is nothing here.  You are not exactly floating --
it is simply that there is nothing left to float in, nothing to mark motion or
stillness, no up, no down, no now.  There is just... nothing.  And somewhere out
in that nothing, patient and unhurried, something is waiting for you.~
FLAGS  295182337
Sect   9
DOOR 3
You see nothing special here.~
~
0 0 31039
End

#31053
NAME   In A Grassy Field~
DESCR
This field is full of short grasses and small wildflowers.  The air is crisp and
clear, but a bit chilly because of the elevation.  The sky is dominated
by the mountains to the north, even as close as you are to them.  Not too far to
the west, you can see the forest ends at the base of the mountainside.  You can
also see some recent landslides from this distance.

~
FLAGS  0
Sect   2
DOOR 0
You see nothing special here.~
~
0 0 31024
DOOR 1
You see nothing special here.~
~
0 0 31054
End

